": "An illustrated book", "type": "IMAGE", "fileName": "Open book", "imageUrl": "Open book-kPChp-44V0SRSfHRH4TAf.png", "fileIdentifier": "kPChp-44V0SRSfHRH4TAf", "textEditorState": null, "labelEditorState": "<p></p>\n"}, {"alt": "A drawing a of an old-fashioned kettle, where you can see the inside mechanisms.", "type": "IMAGE", "fileName": "Vintage teapot", "imageUrl": "Vintage teapot-EjgS1LctUEq7V3A0skwWR.png", "fileIdentifier": "EjgS1LctUEq7V3A0skwWR", "textEditorState": null, "labelEditorState": "<p></p>\n"}], "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": {"heading": "", "checkList": [{"key": "sySUfRMFNP8TUCAzIs7ux", "checked": false, "listItem": ""}], "description": ""}, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 487114426, "text": null, "order": 3, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "modalId": 434, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": 0, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "CAROUSEL", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": null, "dimensions": "{\"height\":null,\"width\":null}", "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"scrollingImage": false}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": [{"alt": "A pine cone", "type": "IMAGE", "fileName": "pine cone", "imageUrl": "pine cone-QVD1h498ZDvDqUMA_LXCH.png", "fileIdentifier": "QVD1h498ZDvDqUMA_LXCH", "textEditorState": null, "labelEditorState": "<p></p>\n"}, {"alt": "A mug", "type": "IMAGE", "fileName": "Mug", "imageUrl": "Mug-YhZCTrYdr5gblKtIcq0yw.png", "fileIdentifier": "YhZCTrYdr5gblKtIcq0yw", "textEditorState": null, "labelEditorState": "<p></p>\n"}, {"alt": "A tree", "type": "IMAGE", "fileName": "Tree", "imageUrl": "Tree-YHy5Darqh93zVkvQ7Joqg.png", "fileIdentifier": "YHy5Darqh93zVkvQ7Joqg", "textEditorState": null, "labelEditorState": "<p></p>\n"}, {"alt": "A paperclip", "type": "IMAGE", "fileName": "Paperclip", "imageUrl": "Paperclip-WehJJqT5DLSnbirOXqbsi.png", "fileIdentifier": "WehJJqT5DLSnbirOXqbsi", "textEditorState": null, "labelEditorState": "<p></p>\n"}], "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": {"heading": "", "checkList": [{"key": "vZBTyfStK97TgXRpJcS1R", "checked": false, "listItem": ""}], "description": ""}, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 487114419, "text": null, "order": 2, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "modalId": 434, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": 0, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "EDITOR", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": null, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": "<h2>Object</h2>\n<p>You can use any object, from something really every-day like a shoe to something more mysterious. It could be something from in your house like a mug or something you have found when out on a walk like a leaf. You might be able to pick it up like a pine cone or it might be enormous like a tree. You can choose anything!</p>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": {"heading": "", "checkList": [{"key": "1tSkSlHxLt-iAP6L3QjuQ", "checked": false, "listItem": ""}], "description": ""}, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 487114393, "text": null, "order": 1, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "modalId": 434, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": 0, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "EDITOR", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": null, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": "<p>Here are some ideas of objects and pictures you could use:</p>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": {"heading": "", "checkList": [{"key": "hA6-XRteAwlW24ZaEhlS-", "checked": false, "listItem": ""}], "description": ""}, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}], "details": {"id": 434, "name": "Object and picture suggestions", "logCreatedAt": "2024-11-12T11:26:30.520977", "logUpdatedAt": "2024-11-12T11:26:30.520977", "logCreatedById": 21670528, "logUpdatedById": 21670528, "nameForContentDev": "I notice / I think / I wonder suggestions"}}, "order": 2, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "MODAL", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 35481583, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": 434, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": {"heading": "", "checkList": [{"key": "H2Tz1RJ0xAEPBDLX56TYG", "checked": false, "listItem": ""}], "description": ""}, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 487111198, "text": null, "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 5, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "EDITOR", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 35481583, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": "<h2>Note:</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: rgb(251,160,38);\">I notice</span> is things you can see (or feel or smell or hear).</li>\n<li><span style=\"color: rgb(251,160,38);\">I think</span> is ideas you have about it and things you can work out.</li>\n<li><span style=\"color: rgb(251,160,38);\">I wonder</span> is things you want to know or are not sure about.</li>\n</ul>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": {"heading": "", "checkList": [{"key": "lcFE0-mKMKHjY7vXPBKxL", "checked": false, "listItem": ""}], "description": ""}, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 487111143, "text": null, "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 3, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "EDITOR", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 35481583, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": "<h2>The activity:</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Tell your child that you've found this interesting thing or picture and you want to chat about it.&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Begin by saying \"<span style=\"color: rgb(251,160,38);\">I notice</span>…\" and completing the sentence with something you notice, e.g. if it is a sieve, \"<span style=\"color: rgb(251,160,38);\">I notice</span> it has lots of little holes in it.\"</li>\n<li>Ask what they notice and encourage them to start their answer with \"<span style=\"color: rgb(251,160,38);\">I notice</span>\".</li>\n<li>You could do a couple of things you notice each.</li>\n<li>Repeat with \"<span style=\"color: rgb(251,160,38);\">I think</span>\" and \"<span style=\"color: rgb(251,160,38);\">I wonder</span>\".</li>\n</ol>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": {"heading": "", "checkList": [{"key": "3TZklnMszccZfBjxQKwVE", "checked": false, "listItem": ""}], "description": ""}, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}]